Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat Luffy, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.04,0:22:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't find him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.94,0:22:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gave us a slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.34,0:22:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got thousands of\NMarines here looking for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, no one can find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.82,0:22:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he somehow already\Ninside the courthouse? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even an insect could have\Ngotten past our defenses, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:22:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.29,0:22:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must find Straw Hat at any cost, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last building.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gotta be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there isn't a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.14,0:23:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks kinda far, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.74,0:23:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, guess I'll try jumping over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.76,0:23:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.44,0:23:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Air door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.12,0:23:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the bullies working\Nwith that stupid pigeon guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There seemed to be some discrepancies\Nbetween the report and the actual situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.52,0:23:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.43,0:23:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you just appear like that? Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.22,0:23:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.13,0:23:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, it did\Nseem a little suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way you only took out five Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.00,0:23:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you really surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.04,0:23:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An invasion like this is unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.80,0:23:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the furthest\Nanyone has ever infiltrated
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.42,0:23:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into the mouth of the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.52,0:24:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.34,0:24:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how long do you\Nplan to keep fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.50,0:24:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I die.
